{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And this for Judah.</b> And this is the request that I ask and pray also for the land of Judah, within which the inheritance of Simeon is interspersed — that they not die in battle, for together they would go out to war." "<b>And he said: Hear, HaShem, the voice of Judah.</b> And besides what he said, 'And this for Judah,' he also said, 'Hear, HaShem, the voice of Judah,' when he prays in battle or otherwise." "<b>May His hands be abundant for him, and may You be a help from his adversaries.</b> You be His hands, fighting on his behalf, and be also abundant for him and avenger of his vengeance, and also a help from his adversaries when they fight against him."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:31.750444726Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}